Third-party code included in this repository
--------------------------------------------
None yet. This repository holds architecture docs and an empty skeleton.

Rule: when a slice ports code from a third-party project, it adds that project
here in the same commit, with the project name, URL, license, the exact files or
functions taken, and the full license text when the license requires it.
See AGENTS.md ("License boundary and notices").

Planned ports (see docs/MIGRATION.md). Each will be listed here when it lands:
- farzaa/clicky (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Farza): non-activating floating panel
  configuration and permission polling cadence (1.5 s) for apps/mac.
- obra/superpowers (MIT): TDD and verification skills loaded into build workers
  (vendored skill files keep their license header).
- nizos/tdd-guard (MIT): PreToolUse hook pattern for build workers.

Ideas only, no code copied
--------------------------
- kortix-ai/CompanyOS (Elastic License 2.0): verifier, change requests, swarms.
