- GeneralUserModels/gum (MIT): proposition model with confidence, revise, decay.
  Its screen observer is never used.
- getzep/graphiti (Apache-2.0): bi-temporal episodes, entities and edges.
- storytold/craft-anything (MIT or Apache-2.0): check callable mid-build,
